(6608687, 985226, 41129, '<td valign="top">hmm, being a fan of the crow,, i just double checked IMDB and tim burton had nothing to do with the crow... can''t even find a film he''s been involved in that has crow in the title.. and the challenge says "inspired by a tim burton FILM"<br/> <br/>Can you enlighten us to the connection to the challenge description here please?? If there isn''t one then surely, as good as this image is, it shouldn''t get the ribbon.. if there is a connection then i shall gladly stand corrected...<br/> <br/>As I say, lovely image though..</td>', 'hmm, being a fan of the crow,, i just double checked IMDB and tim burton had nothing to do with the crow... can''t even find a film he''s been involved in that has crow in the title.. and the challenge says "inspired by a tim burton FILM" Can you enlighten us to the connection to the challenge description here please?? If there isn''t one then surely, as good as this image is, it shouldn''t get the ribbon.. if there is a connection then i shall gladly stand corrected... As I say, lovely image though..', '2011-12-02 11:15:23.000000', NULL, 0),
