(6611374, 985352, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh drat.  Didn''t vote nor look because I''ve never been able to make it through a Tim Burton anything.  But I just spotted this through the side window, when I didn''t know the context, and it''s just super-duper.  I''d not knowingly pay to see the first few minutes of another Tim Burton movie, but I''d certainly have paid good money to watch you take this picture, prone and wet body slowly writhing around a stilled arm.  <i>That''s</i> entertainment!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-12-05 17:22:41.</i></td>', 'Oh drat.  Didn''t vote nor look because I''ve never been able to make it through a Tim Burton anything.  But I just spotted this through the side window, when I didn''t know the context, and it''s just super-duper.  I''d not knowingly pay to see the first few minutes of another Tim Burton movie, but I''d certainly have paid good money to watch you take this picture, prone and wet body slowly writhing around a stilled arm.  That''s entertainment!', '2011-12-05 17:22:11.000000', '2011-12-05 17:22:41.000000', 0),
