(6940434, 985190, 152252, '<td valign="top">First - great composition. Second I love old, damaged places like that. Third - you showed that place in such an amazing way that I gotta add it to my favorite! The texture of everything is just breathtaking<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-12-23 02:12:01.</i></td>', 'First - great composition. Second I love old, damaged places like that. Third - you showed that place in such an amazing way that I gotta add it to my favorite! The texture of everything is just breathtaking', '2012-12-23 02:11:03.000000', '2012-12-23 02:12:01.000000', 0);
